### Rebuilding an invalidated slot — POST /actuator/cdc
# Closes the engine, drops the invalidated slot and its stored position, and starts a new one at the current end
# of the log. Every refusal, and whether it is worth repeating: ../../contracts/in/operations.md

@host = http://localhost:1010
@recoverySecret = paste-the-CDC_RECOVERY_SECRET-value-here

### Rebuild the slot.
POST {{host}}/actuator/cdc
X-Cdc-Recovery-Secret: {{recoverySecret}}
